WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:22.300
[Cold Pouring Rain, Pulsing Synth-Bass, and Menacing Industrial Beat]

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:28.684
The front door clicks, a final sound

00:01:28.684 --> 00:01:33.500
A world of silence all around

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.500
Just pouring rain on cold blacktop

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.852
A spinning life that has to stop

00:01:42.092 --> 00:01:47.500
My voice of shattered, useless glass

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.800
Is packed away, a future past

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:56.344
This curbstone is an icy throne

00:01:56.364 --> 00:02:02.500
I've never felt so all alone

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.500
Just gotta get to the airport

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.217
Don't care how, don't care what it costs

00:02:10.577 --> 00:02:15.500
A thousand miles from my safe port

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.500
A lifeline I can't bear to have lost

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:26.000
This city's just a concrete cage

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.622
Gotta turn another page

00:02:31.722 --> 00:02:35.200
Just gotta get to the airport

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.813
It's the only prayer I've got

00:02:37.813 --> 00:02:42.054
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:42.054 --> 00:02:47.500
The streetlights bleed a hazy glare

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:51.800
On empty houses, standing there

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:57.000
My arms are burning, wheels are slow

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:02.200
A dozen blocks still left to go

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:07.000
The chill gets down inside my bones

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.500
To whispered fears and silent moans

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:17.500
Is anybody watching me?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:22.800
Or am I just too lost to see?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.359
Just gotta get to the airport

00:03:26.359 --> 00:03:31.842
Don't care how, don't care what it costs

00:03:32.022 --> 00:03:37.000
A thousand miles from my safe port

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.500
A lifeline I can't bear to have lost

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:46.691
This city's just a concrete cage

00:03:46.731 --> 00:03:51.500
Gotta turn another page

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.200
Just gotta get to the airport

00:03:55.241 --> 00:03:57.488
It's the only prayer I've got

00:03:57.488 --> 00:04:02.695
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:04:02.695 --> 00:04:08.500
A flash of faces in my mind

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:13.500
The only true north I can find

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:18.500
A sister's love, a steady hand

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:24.500
Across this cold and broken land

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:31.000
It's just enough to keep me whole

00:04:31.387 --> 00:04:38.933
To fight and reclaim my own soul...

00:04:38.933 --> 00:05:25.000
[Raw, Angry Distorted Guitar Solo]

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:30.146
Airport... airport...

00:05:30.146 --> 00:05:35.000
Gotta get there...

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:55.000
[Drum Machine, Pulsing Bass, and Pouring Rain]

00:05:55.000 --> 00:06:00.138
Airport... airport...

00:06:00.138 --> 00:06:01.720
Gotta get there...
